message: "If you use or discuss this release, please cite Resolutive Science v0.4.0."
title: "Resolutive Science: Post-Falsification Diagnostic Release"
version: "0.4.0"
date-released: "2026-09-16"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Matos"
    given-names: "Marcelo Roldão"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-6075-4680"
