url: "https://github.com/marceloroldao/resolutive-science"
abstract: >-
  Resolutive Science v0.4.0 is a post-falsification diagnostic negative release.
  It preserves the frozen v0.3 RCMS surrogate and adds Protocols 17–20 to test
  residual topology, radial/transverse consistency, redshift locality, and
  exact-redshift cross-survey concordance. The diagnostic block finds no stable
  cross-survey organizing structure that justifies a data-driven RCMS extension,
  activating DIAGNOSTIC_STOP_NO_EXTENSION. The release also preserves the
  fundamental reconstruction audit of the old RSMS formulation: the current
  Master Equation is not uniquely derived, the audited half-angle 4pi behavior
  is parametrization-only, and selector tests P-A through P-E remain
  underdetermined. This release does not claim discovery of new physics or
  experimental validation of Resolutive Physics.
